msgid "The entries it wrote on the Testnet (transaction ``AntBkfvR2TZBfhvoEBXhTi81BSfkhnFzqfUZ5VruUG6v``)::"
msgstr "Die Einträge, die es auf dem Testnet (Transaktion ``AntBkfvR2TZBfhvoEBXhTi81BSfkhnFzqfUZ5VruUG6v``) schrieb:"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/07_oracle.rst:63
msgid "This dApp sells a 10 USD voucher for DCC at the oracle's price, and refuses a price older than one hour:"
